From 16e958673060ea2dea36766380bf556ff75561f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Torben Haack <t128n@ipv4.8shield.net>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:21:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(windows): add native Windows Service support

Adds 'orbit service install' and 'orbit service uninstall' with --name and --env-file, an SCM control handler wired to the existing graceful-shutdown token, and ORBIT_LOG_FILE for services without a console. Fixes Windows backup restore renames with FILE_SHARE_DELETE and retries on transient sharing violations.
